      "note": "Before writing, apply establishes the receiving leaf’s recorded memory base. It validates the resulting tree against that base and official code, and recomputes the worklist against the same base. An unavailable base returns carryover-failed before writes. Validator refusals or later failures restore the owned pre-call bytes, modes, and directory topology.",
